## Summary

A `Session Open` signpost interval can remain pending when `SessionListView` disappears while its opening task is active.

## Root cause

`startOpeningSession` begins the interval; `onDisappear` cancels `sessionOpenTask`, and the cancelled task returns at `guard !Task.isCancelled` before `SessionOpenSignpost.end`, so the interval is never closed on that path.

