 1598                  if !isPresented { sessionOpenErrorMessage = nil }
```

## Expected behavior

Every begun Session Open interval is ended when its opening task is cancelled during SessionListView disappearance.

## Actual behavior

A Session Open interval can remain pending when SessionListView disappears while its opening task is active.

## Suggested fix

End the interval in the cancellation path (e.g. `defer` around the task body, or end in `onDisappear` when the task is cancelled).

## Impact

Signposts for cancelled opens never close, producing unbalanced intervals and misleading performance traces.
